title Manager Runtime Interaction in Notebook

participant Engineer
participant Notebook
participant Pipeline
participant SharedTaxDB as TaxonomyAccessor DB
participant AlphaManager
participant MappingManager
participant AbundanceManager
participant Results
participant Logs

Engineer->Notebook: Execute manager cells after artifacts are ready
Notebook->Pipeline: build_or_load_tax_accessor(...)
Pipeline->SharedTaxDB: Load cached lineage DB or rebuild

Notebook->MappingManager: run()
MappingManager->Logs: Emit stage logs through injected logger
MappingManager->Results: Read templates/configs and save JSON configs

Notebook->AlphaManager: run(analysis_wide_df, taxon_lookup_df, metadata_cols, tax_accessor)
AlphaManager->SharedTaxDB: Reuse injected taxonomy accessor
AlphaManager->Logs: Emit analysis and UI actions
AlphaManager->Results: Save optional export files

Notebook->AbundanceManager: run(abundance_metadata_matrix, taxon_lookup_df, metadata_cols)
AbundanceManager->Logs: Emit stage logs through injected logger
AbundanceManager->Results: Lazy-build heavy matrices only when needed